# Code owners for YapUI.
#
# This file is what makes `require_code_owner_review` on the `protect-main`
# ruleset mean anything — without it there is no owner to request, and the
# setting silently matches nothing.
#
# Effect: every pull request automatically requests a review from @Tatendaz and
# cannot merge until that review is approving. GitHub does not let anyone
# approve their own pull request, so a contribution always gets a second pair
# of eyes before it lands on `main`.

* @Tatendaz
